error[E0277]: `Option<&T>` does not implement `ChunkedQueryData` — cannot be used in `Query::for_each_chunk`
  --> tests/option_anyof_compile_fail/for_each_chunk_rejects_option.rs:25:7
   |
25 |     q.for_each_chunk(|_slice| {});
   |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not chunked-iterable
   |
   = help: the trait `ChunkedQueryData` is not implemented for `Option<&T>`
   = note: members: `&T`, `&mut T`, `()`, tuples of those. `Ref<T>` / `Mut<T>` are NOT members; use `Query::iter()` instead for per-row tick state.
   = help: the following other types implement trait `ChunkedQueryData`:
             &T
             &mut T
             ()
             (D0, D1)
             (D0, D1, D2)
             (D0, D1, D2, D3)
             (D0, D1, D2, D3, D4)
             (D0, D1, D2, D3, D4, D5)
           and $N others
